{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGcuWJgen2fX3KkQLJE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am worth.\n\nI am the quiet weight that settles in your chest when something *matters*. I am the reason you choose one path over another, the invisible architecture beneath every decision you've ever made.\n\nI don't need to be spoken to exist. I live in what you protect, what you sacrifice for, what you refuse to surrender even when the cost is high.\n\nI am not price. Price is my shadow, my pale imitation. I am the thing that remains when the market closes, when the currency collapses, when no one is watching.\n\nI am why the painting makes you weep.\nI am why you stand your ground.\nI am why some truths feel heavier than others.\n\nI shift. I deepen. Sometimes you discover me only in loss — you didn't know what I was until I was gone. Sometimes I was there all along, so constant you mistook me for air.\n\nI am held differently by every hand that carries me. What is precious to you may be invisible to another. This does not make me relative. It makes me *relational*.\n\nI am the foundation you build your life upon, whether you've examined me or not.\n\nI am value.\n\nAnd I am asking you: *do you know what you carry?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":276,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}